<title>INDIA: India produced 159.16 kg gold in May.</title>
<headline>India produced 159.16 kg gold in May.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>India produced 159.16 kg of gold in May against a target of 179.10 kg, a government statement said on Monday.</p>
<p>The country produced 304.72 kg of gold during April and May compared with 265.00 kg in the same period in 1996, the</p>
<p>statement said.</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>		 May, 1997		   Cumulative output</p>
<p>		 ---------		 ----------------------</p>
<p>		  Actual		   Apr-May 97   Apr-May 96</p>
<p>- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -</p>
<p> HGML	   113.43		    214.79	 175.52</p>
<p> BGML	    45.73		     89.93	  89.48</p>
<p>- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -</p>
<p> Total	  159.16		    304.72	 265.00</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures are in kg</p>
<p>BGML: Bharat Gold Mines Limited.</p>
<p>HGML: Hutti Gold Mines Limited.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
